***NOTE***
The table at the end of this write-up will print correctly only
on a GSI300 or DASI450 terminal (with the plot switch
.it on),
.it and
only if the one of the following sequences is used to print it:
.br
	nroff -ma -T300 /usr/man/man5/greek.5
.br
or
.br
	nroff -ma -T450 /usr/man/man5/greek.5
.br
as appropriate.
.br
